WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.001
In order to deal with what's happening today 

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:04.042
 
we must learn the lessons of the past 

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:08.041
to see that the circumstances we are now facing 

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:11.041
have in fact happened many times before, 

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:18.040
and fall into a big cycle 
that repeats over and over again. 

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:23.206
The most powerful empires in the world followed this cycle for over 500 years 

00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:29.746
and every time they did, 
it was a sign of the changing world order. 

